<!--
  Solid map-pin handle for image text selection. Derived from Material Symbols "location_on"
  (FILL0), keeping only the outer teardrop contour — the inner circle and the ring's inner edge
  are dropped so it's a filled pin with no centre dot. The viewport is sized and the path
  translated so the pin's tip sits at the bottom-centre of the icon, so callers can anchor it at
  the bottom-centre without per-icon offsets.
-->
